		c	When a boat is hit it starts wiggling. You need to consequitively hit it in that window to be able to do\nenough damage until the boat breaks. This method sets that value in the datatracker.\nThe value is initially set to 10 when hit and decreases by one each tick when the boat is not hit.
	m	()I	h	m_28208312
		c	When a boat is hit it starts wiggling. You need to consequitively hit it in that window to be able to do\nenough damage until the boat breaks. This method gets that value in the datatracker.\nThe value is initially set to 10 when hit and decreases by one each tick when the boat is not hit.
	m	(I)V	c	m_85506152
